know, that stands out to you?

00:08:30.300 --> 00:08:32.430
- My friends are better
than me and it's a blessing

00:08:32.430 --> 00:08:34.077
how I find a girl who's better than me.

00:08:34.077 --> 00:08:36.399
We fell in love way back when
I was someone better than me.

00:08:36.399 --> 00:08:39.060
Mentally, the spirit behind those bars,

00:08:39.060 --> 00:08:41.550
I would revise them a
little bit because I think

00:08:41.550 --> 00:08:43.078
I was not giving myself enough credit

00:08:43.078 --> 00:08:46.290
'cause I was going through
