00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:48.090
And I really didn't love myself.

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:49.890
So, there was, really, no love there.

00:08:49.890 --> 00:08:53.478
It was full on judgment and
trying to figure out how I felt

00:08:53.478 --> 00:08:56.160
about myself, like, how
I could live with myself

00:08:56.160 --> 00:08:58.537
or how I could prove to myself
that I could get better.

00:08:58.537 --> 00:09:00.690
I think I should've
given myself more credit.

00:09:00.690 --> 00:09:03.000
I don't think I was, I don't
think I fell in love with her

00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:05.910
when I was better than me writing that.

00:09:05.910 --> 00:09:07.793
I don't think I was a better person then.

00:09:08.850 --> 00:09:11.160
Which I think she also helped me see.

00:09:11.160 --> 00:09:13.168
Even talked about my parents.

00:09:13.168 --> 00:09:16.110
Saying that I won't stop
until I got some gold

00:09:16.110 --> 00:09:18.690
in my neck and I pull my folks outta debt.

00:09:18.690 --> 00:09:20.970
And around my neck right
now, that's not real gold.

00:09:20.970 --> 00:09:24.810
So, I feel like I've been
super blessed with my family.

00:09:24.810 --> 00:09:28.380
And I think there's a, somewhat unhealthy,

00:09:28.380 --> 00:09:31.401
feeling I have of, like, being a burden.

00:09:31.401 --> 00:09:33.720
Not too much, but I can
be a lot to deal with,

00:09:33.720 --> 00:09:35.220
especially for my parents and stuff.

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:38.250
So, I don't know. I just
kind of wanna flip the script

00:09:38.250 --> 00:09:40.200
and just, like, let all
their problems become mine,

00:09:40.200 --> 00:09:41.940
and none of my problems, like, be theirs.

00:09:41.940 --> 00:09:45.780
Like, so yeah. I think that's,
everything I just said,

00:09:45.780 --> 00:09:48.480
that's what this record means to me now.

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:49.890
- Let me look at my list of questions.

