just being around people,

00:10:35.580 --> 00:10:37.560
I, like, I get paranoid on the train.

00:10:37.560 --> 00:10:40.290
But I can't remember not being like this.

00:10:40.290 --> 00:10:41.210
I can't remember what it's like

00:10:41.210 --> 00:10:43.383
to not have social anxiety at all.

00:10:44.280 --> 00:10:46.872
Like, I can't remember
what I was like before.

00:10:46.872 --> 00:10:50.430
Yeah. It's yeah. It's, I
mean, a lot of what I do

00:10:50.430 --> 00:10:51.660
